Randy Kunkee wrote:
> ...there are many login
> IDs which contain uppercase characters or are all uppercase.
> 
> I cannot send mail to anyone with such a login id....

login (and other system utilities that care about user names) respect
case in names.  smtp (mail) is case insensitive.  so all email names are
demoted to lower case.

you have to get rid of the mixed case names.

