To my best knowledge the standard says that internet adresses are 
NOT case sensitive. So you even might be able to configure your local SW to be
cases sensitive, but then you violate the standard. This will probably create 
a lot of trouble with the outside world.

So if you want to conform to the standard, it seems you indeed have to change 
to lower case user names.

Uwe



