This is a local problem of your sendmail which can be avoided
when using the "u"-flag to your local mail delivering software.
I used:


Mlocal, P=/usr/bin/deliver, F=lsDFMShPu, S=10, R=20/40, A=deliver $u
                                      ^
Using this flag sendmail preserves the case when calling
deliver - and everything went fine!

Hope, this helps!

Tilo Schuerer



